1495:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Clock/Std/IfxClock.h ****  * \retval IfxClock_RampSeqStatus Ramp sequence status. Range: \ref IfxClock_RampSeqStatus.
1496:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Clock/Std/IfxClock.h ****  *
1497:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Clock/Std/IfxClock.h ****  *  00B Idle / Frequency constant, not changing
1498:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Clock/Std/IfxClock.h ****  *  01B RampUp / Frequency increasing
1499:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Clock/Std/IfxClock.h ****  *  10B RampDown / Frequency decreasing
1500:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Clock/Std/IfxClock.h ****  */
